        "title": "Authenticated control for hosted swarm dev-loops",
        "summary": "Pause, stop, resume, and status calls now propagate the caller's JWT through to the hosted harness so swarm dev-loops running against remote harnesses no longer fail auth mid-run.",
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "Loop control endpoints (pause/stop/resume/status) now extract the caller's JWT and forward it through the dev-loop control path and detached-run lookup, fixing hosted harness auth for swarm dev-loops.",
